# List pager (LAW)

Canonical: `AIRULES/40-DACORE-LIST-PAGER.md`. Sample: `AIRULES/examples/EX-D08-list-pager.md`.

## MUST

- Accumulating lists: COUNT(*) + LIMIT/OFFSET + interactive AJAX pager on first ship
- HTML: `card-footer dacore-list-pager` (never `--split`, including DACore), `dacore-list-pager-summary`, `dacore-list-pager-nav`, `ul.pagination.mb-0`
- Load `/assets/modules/DACore/css/pages/dotapp-ui/users.css` on `withMenu` `$css`
- `DACore:Page@paginate!` `$callable` as **buttons**, `$href = null`
- Encrypted `data-page` (`Crypto::encrypt`, unique `$key2`). Never `data-dacore-page` in your module
- `$dotapp().live("click", ".shop-page", function (el, e) { … })` — **first arg is the element**
- POST `/api/v1/auth/{Module}/…` + `LoginAndCRC!`; action **MUST NOT** `crcCheck()` again
- Overlay the card; patch rows **and** pager; remove overlay on error too

## MUST NOT

- `function (e) { e.currentTarget }` — `$dotapp().live` calls `handler(el, e)`; clicks silently no-op
- `<a href="?page=">`, `location.reload()`, `history.replaceState` of query params (burns CRC Referer)
- `QueryObject::paginate()['total']` for last_page, or `total = count($rows)` of the current page
- Invent pager CSS / DataTable / a second pagination library
